  <text xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.boiotis.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.boiotis.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0410.boiotis.meineke1840-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0410_boiotis"><head>ΒΟΙΩΤΙΣ</head><pb n="34" facs="urn:hathi:hvd.32044079388682:scan:44" />
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1">
              <note type="apparatus">
                <seg type="continuation">Antiphanis versus Eriphum transtulisse in Meliboeam, Athenaei constat testimonio.</seg>
              </note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1_2" ana="#compiled-duplicate-number #compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2">
              <head>Ι.</head>
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l1">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> Καὶ περὶ μὲν ὄψου γ᾽ ἠλίθιον τὸ καὶ λέγειν</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l2">ὥσπερ πρὸς ἀπλήστους. ἀλλὰ ταυτὶ λάμβανε,</l>
                  <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l3">παρθένε, τὰ μῆλα.</l>
                  <l n="3b" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l3b">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Β.</speaker> καλά γε.</sp>
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> καλὰ δῆτ᾽, ὦ θεοί·</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="4" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l4">νεωστὶ γὰρ τὸ σπέρμα τοῦτ᾽ ἀφιγμένον</l>
                  <l n="5" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l5">εἰς τὰς Ἀθήνας ἐστὶ παρὰ τοῦ βασιλέως.</l>
                  <l n="6" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l6">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Β.</speaker> παρ᾿ Ἑσπερίδων, ὤμην γε.</sp>
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Γ.</speaker> νὴ τὴν Φωσφόρον,</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="7" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l7">φησὶν τὰ χρυσᾶ μῆλα ταῦτ᾽ εἶναι.</l>
                  <l n="7b" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l7b">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Β.</speaker> τρία</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="8" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l8">μόνον ἐστίν.</l>
                  <l n="8b" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l8b">
                    <sp>
                      <speaker>Α.</speaker> ὀλίγον ἐστὶ τὸ καλὸν πανταχοῦ</sp>
                  </l>
                  <l n="9" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-1_2-l9">καὶ τίμιον.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus III p. 84 a</bibl>: Ὅτι δ᾽ ὄντως ἐκ τῆς ἄνω χώρας ἐκείνης κατέβη εἰς τοὺς Ἕλληνας τὸ φυτὸν τοῦτο, ἔστιν εὑρεῖν λεγόμενον καὶ παρὰ τοῖς τῆς κωμῳδίας ποιηταῖς, οἳ καὶ περὶ μεγέθους αὐτῶν τι λέγοντες τῶν κιτρίων μνημονεύειν φαίνονται. Ἀντιφάνης μὲν ἐν Βοιωτίᾳ Καὶ περὶ μὲν ὄψου κτλ.</note>
              <note type="apparatus">Vs. 2 ταῦτα B. — Vs. 7 φησὶν ΑΒΡ. φασὶν VL. Hoc recepit praeeunte Schweighaeusero Dindorfius. Revocavi librorum scripturam et personarum vices paullo aliter distinxi; vulgo enim vs. 6 et 7 usque ad εἶναι ab una persona pronunciantur. At parum commode in eadem enunciatione coniunguntur ὤμην et φασίν. Versantur in scena non duo sed plures interlocutores, quorum quum A dixisset citria mala ex Persia Athenas advecta esse, B ab Hesperidibus se illa apportata existimasse affirmat. Tum Γ (vel etiam A) ad convivas conversa ingerit: <foreign xml:lang="la">Per Dianam, ista haec aurea mala esse credit.</foreign> Cfr ad Eriphi Melib. I, 7. Ibid. ταῦτ᾽ εἶναι PVL. ταυτὶ εἶναι ΑΒ. — Vs. 8 μόνον ΑΒΡ. μόν᾿ VL. ἐστὶ τὸ καλὸν ΑΒ. τὸ καλόν ἐστι PVL. Ceterum hos</note>
            </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-2">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-2-l1">Ἐνεγκεῖν ἐξ ἀγροῦ μοι τῶν ῥοῶν</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-2-l2">τῶν σκληροκόκκων.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus XIV p. 650 e:</bibl>
                <quote>Ἀντιφάνης ἐν Βοιωτίᾳ Ἐνεγκεῖν κτλ.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Ante Schweighaeuserum legebatur ῥοιῶν.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-3">
              <quote>
                <lg>
                  <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-3-l1">Καλέσας τε παρατίθησιν ἐν παροψίδι</l>
                  <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-3-l2">βολβούς.</l>
                </lg>
              </quote>
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus IX p. 367 f:</bibl>
                <quote>ἐπὶ σκεύους οὖν εἴρηκεν (τὸ παροψὶς) — Ἀντιφάνης ἐν Βοιωτίᾳ Καλέσας — παροψίδι.</quote>
              </note>
              <note type="apparatus">Habet etiam Pollux X 88, ubi recte καλέσας τε. Athenaeus τε omittit.</note>
            </div>
            <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0410-boiotis-4">
              <note type="source">
                <bibl>Athenaeus XI p. 474 e:</bibl>
                <quote>ὅτι δὲ καὶ γυναικεῖον κοσμάριόν ἐστι κάνθαρος, Ἀντιφάνης εἴρηκεν ἐν Βοιωτίᾳ.</quote>
              </note>
            </div>
          </div></body></text></TEI>